# Cretli — UI

Before creating or changing UI in `app_front/` or `public/`, read the
`cretli-ui` skill (`.agents/skills/cretli-ui/SKILL.md`). All colours use
`var(--cr-*)` tokens, new modals use `cr-dialog`, and user-facing text goes
through `t('key')`.
